  "lesson": {
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "meta": "交互解题 · 外接球半径",
    "title": "直三棱柱 $ABC$-$A_1B_1C_1$ 中，$AC\\perp AB$，$AC=2$，$AA_1=4$，$AB=6$。点 $E$、$F$ 分别是棱 $AA_1$、$AB$ 上的动点，当折线 $C_1$-$E$-$F$-$B_1$ 的长度即 $C_1E+EF+FB_1$ 最小时，三棱锥 $B_1C_1EF$ 的外接球半径是",
    "answerLabel": "三棱锥 $B_1C_1EF$ 的外接球半径",
    "answerValue": "$\\sqrt{11}$"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "建系",
      "content": "<p>底面直角三角形放在 $z=0$：$A$ 为原点，$AB$ 沿 $x$ 轴，$AC$ 沿 $y$ 轴，高 $4$。</p>$$A(0,0,0),\\ B(6,0,0),\\ C(0,2,0),\\ A_1(0,0,4).$$",
      "highlight": [
        "Axis",
        "Plane_ABC",
        "Len_AB",
        "Len_AC",
        "Len_AA1",
        "Point_E",
        "Point_F"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 13.97,
        "y": 9.48,
        "z": 9.54
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "展开求最短折线",
      "content": "<p>把侧面 $ACC_1A_1$ 与 $ABB_1A_1$ 摊平：$C_1$ 到 $E$ 再到 $F$ 再到 $B_1$ 变成平面折线。最短路径是直线，对应</p>$$E=(0,0,2),\\qquad F=(2,0,0).$$<p>即 $E$ 为 $AA_1$ 中点，$AF=2$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Point_E",
        "Point_F",
        "Point_C1",
        "Point_B1",
        "Line_C1E",
        "Line_EF",
        "Line_FB1",
        "Plane_ABB1A1"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 13.15,
        "y": 13.15,
        "z": 6.14
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "四面体 $B_1C_1EF$ 的外接球",
      "content": "<p>四点 $B_1(6,0,4)$、$C_1(0,2,4)$、$E(0,0,2)$、$F(2,0,0)$。解 $|X-B_1|=|X-C_1|=|X-E|=|X-F|$，得外接半径 $R=\\sqrt{11}$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Point_B1",
